WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.400
Everyone is running AI pilots.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.750
Few are seeing real value: too many pilots, no clear ROI and unclear ownership.

3
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:13.750
Gartner predicted 30 percent of generative AI projects would be abandoned after proof of concept, and expects over 40 percent of agentic AI projects to be canceled by 2027.

4
00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:16.283
AI leaders focus.

5
00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:18.517
BCG found they prioritize 3.5 use cases on average, versus 6.1 for other companies.

6
00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:20.750
Fewer use cases, bigger outcomes.

7
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:26.750
TEAM International starts with where AI should create value: an AI readiness assessment, a maturity heatmap and an AI North Star.

8
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:32.250
Then we score use cases on value and feasibility, and fund only the few that matter.

9
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:37.250
We make sure your data and technology can support them, from AI-ready data to the model gateway, on Azure or AWS.

10
00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:42.750
AI governance and security tier every use case by risk, so you can scale faster with risk under control.

11
00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:48.750
And an AI operating model, with a center of excellence and trained teams, keeps AI delivering across the business.

12
00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:52.900
One partner from strategy to production: consult, validate, build, operate and optimize.

13
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.750
The team that designs your roadmap also builds and runs it.

14
00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:02.750
Our advice comes from teams that ship AI: a six-agent system that processes 108-page documents in 10.8 minutes with zero missed items.

15
00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:07.400
Start with an AI Readiness Assessment, and get a maturity heatmap, prioritized use cases and an execution-ready roadmap.

16
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:11.750
TEAM International.
